A journey like you’ve never imagined.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
The Polar Express is a animation, adventure, family
film directed by Robert Zemeckis.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
When a doubting young boy takes an extraordinary train ride to the North Pole, he embarks on a journey of
self-discovery that shows him that the wonder of life never fades for those who believe.

4
